{"id": "16-1042-2-2", "zh": "以 pha 结尾的词根", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1043-2-4", "zh": "puppha，义为开放（开花）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1043-5-9", "zh": "这个词根既可作不及物动词，也可作及物动词。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1043-10-11", "zh": "pupphati（开花）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1043-12-21", "zh": "puppha（花）、pupphana（开花）、pupphita（已开花的）、pupphituṃ（为了开花）、pupphitvā（开花之后）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1043-22-25", "zh": "有花的树木开花。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1043-26-33", "zh": "陆上生的、水中生的花，全都在那一刻开放。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1043-34-46", "zh": "名叫曼殊沙的树，无论水中还是陆上有多少种花，它全都能开出来。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1044-2-4", "zh": "tupha，义为伤害。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1044-5-6", "zh": "tophati（伤害）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1045-2-6", "zh": "dapha、daphi、vappha，义为行走。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1045-7-8", "zh": "daphati（行走）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1045-9-10", "zh": "damphati（行走）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1045-11-12", "zh": "vapphati（行走）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1046-2-4", "zh": "dipha，义为说、战斗、责难、伤害、给予。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1046-5-6", "zh": "dephati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1046-7-8", "zh": "depha。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1047-2-4", "zh": "tapha，义为满足。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1047-5-9", "zh": "满足（titti）就是使人满意（tappana）；taphati（满足）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1048-2-4", "zh": "dupha，义为染污。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1048-5-7", "zh": "受到染污，就是染污（upakkilesa）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1048-8-9", "zh": "dophati（染污）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1049-2-4", "zh": "gupha，义为编结。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1049-5-7", "zh": "编结（gantha）就是打结。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1049-8-9", "zh": "gophati（编结）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1050-2-4", "zh": "以上是以 pha 结尾的词根的词形。", "confidence": 85}
